{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20273","headline":"讌客词 · 张籍","name":"讌客词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上客不用顾金羁，主人有酒君莫违。\n请君看取园中花，地上渐多枝上稀。\n山头树影不见石，溪水无风应更碧。\n人人齐醉起舞时，谁觉翻衣与倒帻。\n明朝花尽人已去，此地独来空绕树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}